1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,210
The current result is a bounded existence proof, not a general text-to-video model.

2
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:18,393
Given one of three registered prompts and an integer seed, the system emits a finite native program, expands that program into exactly seventy-two thousand irregular Jewels, and renders forty-nine video frames.

3
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:20,904
The important point is causal direction.

4
00:00:20,904 --> 00:00:26,867
At inference, information flows from text to program to a continuous spacetime field to pixels.

5
00:00:26,867 --> 00:00:30,822
It does not flow from a target video backward into an encoding.

6
00:00:31,522 --> 00:00:37,090
A reconstruction system can look generative while secretly receiving most of the answer.

7
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:46,519
So Gate two-b-zero explicitly removes four channels: no input video, no fitted target field, no target-derived block program, and no held-out latent.

8
00:00:46,519 --> 00:00:49,746
The only semantic input is the exact prompt string.

9
00:00:49,746 --> 00:00:53,226
The only stochastic input is the declared integer seed.

10
00:00:53,226 --> 00:01:02,907
Training-owned source tokens remain in the vocabulary; that is a limitation we will return to, but no test target participates in compilation or casting.

11
00:01:03,607 --> 00:01:15,347
The exact speaker normalizes whitespace, looks up the prompt's dense scene index, and then creates a deterministic random generator from the declared seed plus one-thousand-and-nine times the scene.

12
00:01:15,347 --> 00:01:20,980
A seeded permutation of the six source tokens owned by that scene chooses two distinct entries.

13
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:26,376
The first becomes the foreground trajectory token; the second becomes the background token.

14
00:01:26,376 --> 00:01:34,499
Therefore prompt plus seed uniquely determines the program, while changing the seed changes the donor pair without consulting any pixels.

15
00:01:35,199 --> 00:01:43,291
A compiled utterance contains a semantic scene token, a foreground token, a background token, the seed, and an audit condition.

16
00:01:43,291 --> 00:01:45,011
Scene is not a pixel class.

17
00:01:45,011 --> 00:01:49,726
It selects a persistent semantic path through the entire spacetime window.

18
00:01:49,726 --> 00:01:53,676
Foreground and background are not individual Gaussians either.

19
00:01:53,676 --> 00:02:00,239
They name coherent, source-backed macro programs containing tens of thousands of physical Jewel tokens.

20
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:08,012
This hierarchy is the central design decision: the small program owns global coherence; local Jewels own rendering detail.

21
00:02:08,712 --> 00:02:13,108
For every time slab, the realizer stores a two-dimensional semantic path.

22
00:02:13,108 --> 00:02:16,902
It computes each donor Jewel's squared distance from that path.

23
00:02:16,902 --> 00:02:22,683
The foreground contribution is the thirty-six thousand closest Jewels from the foreground donor.

24
00:02:22,683 --> 00:02:28,525
The background contribution is the thirty-six thousand farthest Jewels from the background donor.

25
00:02:28,525 --> 00:02:32,138
This rank-balanced construction is deliberately count-exact.

26
00:02:32,138 --> 00:02:41,352
It avoids assuming that two valid fields have the same density inside one fixed radius, while forcing both donors to own exactly half of the final field.

27
00:02:42,052 --> 00:02:50,710
Each selected row carries a continuous centroid and three active physical token identifiers: covariance, surface color, and color gradient.

28
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:55,257
Every active vocabulary contains one-thousand-and-twenty-four prototypes.

29
00:02:55,257 --> 00:03:04,351
Decoding substitutes the selected prototype values into the canonical twenty-two-dimensional feature layout while leaving the centroid continuous.

30
00:03:04,351 --> 00:03:09,833
A small Gaussian jitter is applied and clamped strictly inside normalized volume bounds.

31
00:03:09,833 --> 00:03:13,570
The result is an irregular set, not a Cartesian output grid.

32
00:03:14,270 --> 00:03:22,042
The support-correct renderer evaluates that field on every requested frame grid and encodes the result as an H.264 video.

33
00:03:22,042 --> 00:03:37,842
The proof passes because text controls which coherent programs are cast: across nine exact programs, intended prompt retrieval is eight of nine, and correct prompt programs beat both cyclic-shuffled and null generations in all nine matched cases.

34
00:03:37,842 --> 00:03:43,109
But the vocabulary is still three prompts and eighteen source-backed macro tokens.

35
00:03:43,109 --> 00:03:46,128
This proves the mechanism, not the final scale.
